		(property "Note" "LDO input filter, added 2026-08-22. The AMS1117's PSRR collapses to ~30 dB by 100 kHz, so motor PWM ripple on VM walks onto +3V3. NOT the 600R C1002 used on VDDA/VCAN5 - that part is only 200 mA / 450 mohm and the LDO input carries the whole 3V3 load. This one is 2 A / 50 mohm, so ~12 mV drop and no dropout penalty. PROVISIONAL - vault record owed"
			(at 127 68.58 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
