		(property "Note" "Reverse-polarity P-FET re-rated for 24 V: AO4421 -60 V / -6.2 A / 40 mOhm, same SO-8 footprint as the V1.0 AO4407C (-30 V, no margin at 28 V). ~1 A at 24 V -> 40 mW. V_GS clamped by D7 (12 V zener) since |V_GS| = V_IN > the +/-20 V gate limit. No COTS record (commodity); LCSC before order."
